{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_86_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_86","textTraditional":"一、二十有三年，春，齊侯伐宋圍緡邑。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_86_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_86","textTraditional":"不言圍，此其言圍何？疾重故也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_86_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_86","textTraditional":"二、夏五月庚寅，宋公慈父卒。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_86_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_86","textTraditional":"何以不書葬？盈乎諱也。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_86_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_86","textTraditional":"三、秋，楚人伐陳。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_86_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_86","textTraditional":"四、冬十有一月，〈木巳〉子卒。","sentenceOrder":6}],"overrides":{}}